{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "087ff87e076c3200da7aec869ced8be6e53a4a2cf1f034bae0b0de6c1b1ca3b4", "ja": "ま、そういう時もあるし", "zh": "嘛，也有这种时候嘛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "46bb7ee6c1022d1501b7ec51031dd428ee47619aa542222e43e33e9dfcdba13e", "ja": "推しの引退にショックを受け、劇場に顔を出\nさなくなった亜利沙。心配した奈緒達は家に\n様子を見に行くが、一応元気な亜利沙の様子\nを見て一安心。両親から亜利沙の行動を聞い\nた奈緒は、何やら妙案を思いつく。", "zh": "因推崇的偶像引退而受到打击，亜利沙不再到剧场露面。担心她的奈绪等人去家里看看情况，看到亜利沙姑且还算精神，便放下心来。听父母说起亜利沙的行动后，奈绪似乎想到了一个妙计。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "a598af96b291e8dfc3a7b3bc6c70e0d4c89ca815df264aa9f798bb13d6233387", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー……。ふぅ。", "zh": "一、二、三……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "087f99e64ffd5928a90d22e29412e5837cc07ed8c6ca268198f6df3c3118b0ff", "ja": "今日はこんなところかな。みんな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "今天就到这里吧。大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "ff42ff7689ac0627d5d59b518f78b7e2caae57ea64d14b78097cc93bdaae235d", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。亜利沙ちゃん、\nもう3日もお休みしてますけど、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。亚利沙已经连着请假3天了，是出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bde9496ace321b9fb6f17f14ba717ce8e76ca51931f54f0749fb3577372ab3a8", "ja": "ああ、それは……。じつは、亜利沙の推しアイドルが\n引退宣言をしたんだ。さすがに堪えたみたいで。", "zh": "啊，那是因为……其实，亚利沙最喜欢的偶像宣布要引退了。看来这对她打击确实不小。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "37a30c0aeb9b3c6d64f055218c4c3cd433b291be5724d7888c80d52b91b6477b", "ja": "推しって、るるちゃんって子？　ありゃ～。\nそれは……ダメージすごいだろうなぁ……。", "zh": "推的就是叫露露的孩子？哎呀～那可真是够受打击的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "af89511eeae744b78573cf80bd088c00427236ae142eba44098c71a792d71ebc", "ja": "せやねん。なんとか元気出してもらいたいんやけど、\nこればっかりはどうもなぁ……。", "zh": "是啊。虽然想想办法让她打起精神来，可这事还真是……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "a741036bdf0b07f86a53e92ffda66f67460952a746e9db4c6818ca6ccfc0d635", "ja": "亜利沙さんがいないと……なんだか静かだね。", "zh": "没有亚利沙在……总觉得好安静啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "23bc3021f0369c599acca3ea1cae6ef316481cabde6c9375e236eda913e29a04", "ja": "よし。亜利沙の家に行ってみるよ。\nちょうど渡したいものもあったし。", "zh": "好。那我去亚利沙家看看吧。\n正好也有东西想交给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "0cf1ad300371b83b0c8a8e8b4c2916a7ace068f9ae329422e631976e06433e82", "ja": "私も行きます！　デュオの相方やし……。\nやっぱり、心配やし！", "zh": "我也去！毕竟我是双人组合的搭档……而且，还是很担心她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "ae9e8c939f9aae2c6a9301f2443b43eda5350474dfd8df1a7b5d0c629288a206", "ja": "私たちも行こっ！\nなんとか元気付けてあげなくちゃ……！", "zh": "我们也去吧！\n得想办法让她振作起来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1015_arisapapa", "source_sha256": "736943d21cdc0d0f56d6d82b8333bfe85e5c36aaa14ac52a68049787aaa6362b", "ja": "765プロのみなさん、お待ちしておりました。\nいや～、この度はご足労いただいちゃって……。", "zh": "765事务所的各位，恭候多时了。\n哎呀～，这次真是劳烦各位特地跑一趟了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e92a47ef056e6d1ed5772f9d3c4a4fa1542983560cf4f7242fb7966cd3035291", "ja": "こちらこそ、いつもお世話になっております。\nそれで、亜利沙さんの様子は……？", "zh": "我们才是，一直承蒙您的关照。\n那么，亜利沙小姐的情况……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1017_arisamama", "source_sha256": "a3f4c5a46ee6ae535c2c09d2ba9ab86e14e12c708b4400d0c6916691a6955007", "ja": "学校にはちゃんと行けてるんですけど、\nやっぱりまだ落ち込んでますね。", "zh": "虽然确实有好好去上学，\n但看起来还是挺消沉的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "7e52f54a1be4a0d685d6c8fbb6b72355bc1eb771829986410651aa8b542ba9f0", "ja": "そっか……。", "zh": "这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1019_arisapapa", "source_sha256": "44ed09699c16cf82cc55bbebb737bda5f9e123bbc10f0b39eedc67924ca004c0", "ja": "でも、亜利沙も私も、こういうことは初めてじゃないん\nですよ。別れは、アイドルを推す者の宿命ですから。", "zh": "不过，亚利沙和我都不是第一次经历这种事了。因为离别，就是支持偶像之人的宿命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1020_arisamama", "source_sha256": "566768cf505bfa04dc4633900fc658787b6611746c3a3773ee093b7095b7f963", "ja": "ええ。数日塞ぎこむのは仕方ないですけど、引退なんか\nがあるたびに、あの子は乗り越えてきましたから。", "zh": "嗯。消沉几天也是没办法的，不过每当发生退役之类的事，\n那孩子都挺过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1021_arisapapa", "source_sha256": "06673f08d01f337b032461fdd151509cfae2c4476d70b7ce29391a96f95e4e28", "ja": "そう！　亜利沙は強い子なんです！\nあ、ちょっと親バカっぽいかな！　あははは！", "zh": "没错！亚利沙是个坚强的孩子！\n啊，这么说好像有点像溺爱孩子的家长！啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "5fef92d2601ce347b93908d6eef2ae985eda38b1278e3485fd1e767620e4cf54", "ja": "パパ、ママ、どうしたの……？", "zh": "爸爸，妈妈，怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1023_arisapapa", "source_sha256": "88d82f1d8fc937d5f8e920ee3ba86cb0899eea8a64c08b0a535eaf1a8f604202", "ja": "あ、亜利沙！\n765プロのみなさんが来てくれてるよ！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙！\n765位专业人士来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f1e1f9cc491c105a052e77e07a774fa0a70a0dd48d0948088f3f2b173e99032", "ja": "ひっ！　あ、あの、あのあのあのっ、\nレッスン休んですみません～！！！", "zh": "呀！那、那个，那个那个那个……\n对不起，没参加练习～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "845a24b0cf0572a0ef6819e00e8e4ad1cbef4b4a48da6191fb8b5fe14f9920f6", "ja": "あっ、逃げた……。", "zh": "啊，逃走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "b7f6829047487fdbf0e9c4124294737b3332a1ff29125ea6fbaa5a07165903b2", "ja": "でも、顔色は全然良うなったんちゃうかな。\nなんや、ちょっと安心したわ。", "zh": "不过，她的脸色不是已经好多了吗。\n怎么说呢，我也稍微放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1027_arisamama", "source_sha256": "caeaef70373862b87ea28f4f2fd52d2039781ef57bd328b83598a599af77f9f9", "ja": "あの子は大丈夫ですよ。ごはんも食べられてますし。\n毎日るるちゃんのCDを聴いて、自分を励ましてます。", "zh": "那孩子没事的。也有好好吃饭。\n每天都在听小瑠瑠的CD，给自己打气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1028_arisapapa", "source_sha256": "6517fa2844969633e92747ee6e8699f859d3df6aa919386e55eff5d6a72a9c51", "ja": "あの子とるるちゃんの出会いは衝撃的なものでした。\nそう、あれは5年前の夏……", "zh": "那个孩子和露露的相遇是令人震撼的。\n没错，那是5年前的夏天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1029_arisamama", "source_sha256": "441dacc73676e4a63c1677430d1eedf59b752ecd2327285aa764f59096554f74", "ja": "もう、あなた！\nその話は長くなるんだからやめて！", "zh": "真是的，老公！\n那件事说起来可就长了，快别提了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "38fcbc91dad149df3f7064b3c56abb77ec92ad9c123dec1e46ed32dc85105bc4", "ja": "あははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30", "ja": "ふふっ。", "zh": "呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "ef47b560e2e4c73c5e9f2567ed85f05526eca37fdc4d49f0f97b27abc56211e1", "ja": "ふふっ！", "zh": "呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "15cccaa9f158eeca06ae2330d9d8890d7be5d4d9f4a15147dbaae78d622a3636", "ja": "あはははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "2cd861b32b36172c8190ab2cdc33749390502f4710f58fd6e0fbdf8ce25e5148", "ja": "亜利沙さん、思ったより平気そうだね。\n……よかった。", "zh": "亚利沙，看来你比想象中要坚强呢。\n……太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "f62a726556013aacf928013bc8e73e191d00dc2b340c4b5bd675d2be3ab78fa3", "ja": "うん♪　今は悲しい気持ちと戦ってるところ\nみたいだけど、きっと立ち直れそうだね！", "zh": "嗯♪虽然她现在看起来还在和悲伤的情绪\n作斗争，但一定能够重新振作起来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_04_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "352499c1e3c68fa46db928de6a4241999be417927fd3522d90f0b312c4d6ee18", "ja": "毎日るるちゃんの曲を聴いてるんか～。\n……あっ。", "zh": "每天都在听露露的歌啊～。  \n……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
